        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (b), by inserting after the words “advocates and solicitors” the words “and limited liability law partnerships”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/52/eng@/~cl_14__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/52/eng@/~cl_14__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (c) the following paragraph: “(c) require advocates and solicitors and limited liability law partnerships to make payments by way of contributions or premiums on any indemnity or policy taken out under subsection (1) and provide for proceedings by the Malaysian Bar or its insurers against any advocate and solicitor who or limited liability law partnership which fails to do so for recovery of the appropriate contributions or premiums;”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/52/eng@/~cl_14__para_b__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
