        "@value": "by substituting for the shoulder note the following shoulder note: “Effect of agreement not performed due to death of advocate and solicitor or winding up of limited liability law partnership”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/52/eng@/~cl_34__para_b",
