      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 122 the following section: “Interpretation 122. In this Part, unless the context otherwise requires— “advocate and solicitor” includes the executors, administrators and assignees of an advocate and solicitor; “limited liability law partnership” includes the receivers, managers and liquidators of a limited liability law partnership.”. Amendment of section 123"
